  "html": "<div id=\"questionContainer\" class=\"questionWidget\" style=\"display: block;\"><div class=\"questionWidget-header\"><div class=\"questionWidget-title\">Question 14</div><div class=\"questionWidget-helpButton\">?</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-text\">Sarah conducts an experiment <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"209\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"227\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>40</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> times to see how quickly a machine sorts a bin of parts. The table below shows the results of her experiments.<p></p>\n<table width=\"300\" rules=\"all\" cellpadding=\"5\" align=\"center\" style=\"border:1px solid black; margin: auto; margin-bottom: 4mm; margin-top: 4mm\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td height=\"25\" bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\">Time (seconds)</td>\n<td height=\"25\" bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\">Frequency</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"20\" style=\"text-align:center\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"210\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3C\"></mj